WEBVTT

00:19:29.385 --> 00:19:32.221
But excellence later
in your career is possible,

00:19:32.245 --> 00:19:35.015
and there are a few ways
you can get there.

00:19:35.039 --> 00:19:36.356
Lyn is living proof

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:38.400
that you don't have to avoid
career decline

00:19:38.424 --> 00:19:40.226
by shifting from doing into teaching.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:43.210
You can actually reinvigorate
your career by experimenting,

00:19:43.234 --> 00:19:44.604
by doing something new.

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:47.940
In Lyn's case, she did
something completely new.

00:19:47.964 --> 00:19:51.285
We saw her in action one Saturday
near her home in Manhattan.

00:19:51.309 --> 00:19:52.485
(Birds chirping)

00:19:52.509 --> 00:19:55.259
LS: We're on Fifth Avenue
in New York City.

00:19:55.807 --> 00:20:00.492
It's called Museum Mile
because everywhere is a museum.